{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51322","headline":"咏走马灯诗 · 无际","name":"咏走马灯诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"团团游了又来游，无个明人指路头。\n除却心中三昧火，枪刀马一齐休。\n（《悦心集》一）（曹汛谓走马灯始见於宋，唐时未有，诗疑出依托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无际","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51322.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51322","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}